Gardenio Monorepo Licensing
==========================

This repository contains multiple components, each released under its own
license. All components are owned by:

    Matt Baker <fimbaz@gmail.com>

Per-component licenses:

  - gardenio/   MIT       (see gardenio/LICENSE)
  - kbeads/    MIT       (see kbeads/LICENSE)
  - beads3d/   MIT       (see beads3d/LICENSE)  [deprecated, see beads-viewer]
  - coop/      BUSL-1.1  (see coop/LICENSE)
                         Change Date 2029-01-01 -> Apache-2.0

Files outside the component directories above (root-level scripts, CI
configuration, documentation, Makefile, etc.) are released under the MIT
License, copyright (c) 2026 Matt Baker <fimbaz@gmail.com>, on the same
terms as gardenio/LICENSE.

When a file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier header, that header is
authoritative for the file.
